# CNexus Project Memory

**Path:** `D:\类脑记忆\CNexus — Observational Cognition Platform`  
**Product:** CNexus — Observational Cognition Platform  
**Updated:** 2026-06-12

## Vision

Persistent Cognitive Runtime **below LLM, above user**. Goal: same being over time, not smarter AI.

**Principles:** Engineering First · Observation ≠ Control · Stability-First · Memory independent of LLM (L1 owns store/recall/lifecycle; LLM only reasons).

**Dimensions (confirmed):** cognitive · personality · memory · emotion · intentionality.

Full doc: `docs/CNEXUS_PERSISTENT_MEMORY.md`

