## L1 Memory (implemented 2026-06-12)

```
MemoryManager (memory/manager.py) — single L1 entry
├── MemoryBlockStore (memory/blocks/)
├── BlockGovernanceHook (approved/flagged/rejected)
├── BlockLifecycleManager (decay/protect/compress)
├── capture_interaction() — episodic + block dual-write
└── HierarchicalRecallEngine — label priority recall + episodic fallback
```

**Blocks:** persona · intent · emotion · working_memory · user_profile · archival_facts · reflective_trace · value_alignment_history  
**Capture routing:** identity→persona, goal→intent, working→working_memory, relationship→user_profile

**Key APIs:**
- `runtime.memory` / `runtime.memory_manager`
- `runtime.maintain_memory()` / `runtime.run_memory_maintenance()`
- `runtime.capture(..., return_detail=True)` for block + governance info

